	)
	(text "VREF and RFB are limited to +/-12 V but the op-amps run from +/-14.7 V, so R39 and a 9.1 V bidirectional clamp protect VREF (under 10.5 V; 56 mW in R39). About 10 Vpp at full code; ZE500.1 RCA input range 0.2-6 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "acd16b9b-989b-5cb4-b4ed-f2f6ab6303bc")
	)
	(text "AD9837 (16 MHz clock) 60 Hz sine -> U5A gain stage -> AD5453 VREF. The 14-bit MDAC sets the amplitude: VOUT = -VREF x code / 16384. U5B is its output stage. Zero scale at power-on."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c871bd6f-cfc3-5cfe-a646-756c2055382f")
	)
